  "operating_model": "Product -> IZAKHONO CREATE -> IZAKHONO ADS -> Audience -> Activation -> Retention -> Referral -> Revenue",
  "principles": [
    "Every product must solve one obvious problem for one primary audience before broad expansion.",
    "Organic distribution and partnerships are preferred before paid acquisition.",
    "Every public product must have a share loop, referral loop or partner-distribution loop.",
    "Activation measures a meaningful user outcome, not registration alone.",
    "Retention comes from recurring utility, community, workflow or content value.",
    "No behavioural surveillance, dark patterns, fake scarcity, spam or deceptive claims.",
    "Regulated claims remain subject to product-specific legal and compliance gates.",
    "IZAKHONO CREATE is the creative source of record and IZAKHONO ADS is the distribution/control layer."
  ],
